# Every file in this repo is stored and checked out EXACTLY as committed.
#
# Without this, Git for Windows (which sets core.autocrlf=true in its system
# config, and which the GitHub windows runner inherits) rewrites every LF to CRLF
# on checkout. Resources/viewer.html would then arrive on Windows 2351 bytes
# larger than the file macOS ships, the embedded page would differ byte for byte
# from the one the Mac app renders, and the damage would be invisible: the page
# still loads, the typing rules just quietly stop matching — on one platform only.
#
# Scripts/embed-resources.py refuses to embed a source containing CR and says so,
# so a checkout that ignores this file fails loudly at build time rather than
# shipping. See CLAUDE.md rule 7.
* -text
